        "created_at": "2013-02-23T20:15:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The claim that any three hero team can beat any villain is NOT a claim that any three hero team can reliably (or even more than 50% of the time) beat any villain.&nbsp; With the right card draws from every deck, any game should be winnable, but depending on the combination 'the right card draws' may be a very specific set.</p>",
