        "created_at": "2013-02-23T20:19:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My 3p Advanced games against the Chairman have mostly borne out your results. &nbsp;I think the only 3 player wins I have achieved are with Savage Mana, Incapacitated Tempest, or Lead from the Front/Next Evolution. &nbsp;I don't think I've ever done Visionary with three players against him, (I generally just play random) but obviously Brain Burn helps a great deal too.</p>",
